window.Apuntes.registrarPane("pyl/u4/practica", "<section class=\"pane\" data-view=\"pyl/u4/practica\" data-tab-owner=\"practica\">\n  <h1>Unidad 4 &mdash; Pr\u00e1ctica: dise\u00f1ar AF y ER</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"pane-intro\">\n    Ejercicios del Trabajo Pr\u00e1ctico I de la c\u00e1tedra, resueltos y ordenados de menor a mayor dificultad.\n    El 80 del TP (sin <code>abba</code> ni <code>baab</code>) lo tomaron en el recuperatorio 2023: est\u00e1\n    resuelto en Evaluaci\u00f3n.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 1 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 5</span>\n    <h2>Longitud par</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {a, b} de longitud par.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>\u03b5</code> (largo 0, y el 0 es par), <code>ab</code>, <code>bb</code>, <code>abba</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>a</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>aba</code>, <code>abbab</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>\n      Qu\u00e9 letras ley\u00f3 no importa: solo si lleva una cantidad <strong>par o impar</strong> de letras.\n      Dos situaciones, dos estados.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Ley\u00f3 una cantidad par de letras. Arranca ac\u00e1 (0 letras): inicial y final.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 una cantidad impar.</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>Cada letra, sea cual sea, cambia la paridad: pasa de un estado al otro.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0 *</td><td>q1</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>q0</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ac\u00e1 no hay nada que adivinar: el AFND es este mismo aut\u00f3mata. Y no le falta ninguna flecha,\n      as\u00ed que ninguna cadena muere: todas llegan al final de la lectura, en q0 o en q1.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e1-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -53 252 106\" width=\"252\" height=\"106\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 Q80.0,-36.0 142.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-7.8 L132.6,-7.4 L136.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M142.7,7.8 Q80.0,36.0 17.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L27.4,7.4 L23.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: una letra cualquiera.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un par de letras cualesquiera.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cero o m\u00e1s pares, o sea largo 0, 2, 4...</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial y final; cualquier letra pasa de q0 a q1 y de q1 a q0).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\u03b5</code></td><td>se queda en q0</td><td>S\u00ed: q0 es final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abb</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q0 &rarr;b q1</td><td>No: largo 3</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abba</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q0 &rarr;b q1 &rarr;a q0</td><td>S\u00ed: largo 4</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> no es \"largo par\": deja afuera <code>ab</code>. El par es de letras <strong>cualesquiera</strong>.</li>\n        <li>Si q0 no es final se pierde <code>\u03b5</code>, que tiene largo 0 (par).</li>\n        <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> es \"al menos una letra\", no tiene nada que ver con la paridad.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 2 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 24</span>\n    <h2>Binarios impares</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas de n\u00fameros binarios impares.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <p>\n      En binario, cada d\u00edgito vale una potencia de 2; todas son pares salvo la del \u00faltimo (vale 1).\n      Entonces un binario es impar <strong>si y solo si termina en 1</strong>. El alfabeto es {0, 1}.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>1</code>, <code>11</code> (3), <code>101</code> (5), <code>0111</code> (7, con un cero adelante).</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code> (no es un n\u00famero), <code>0</code>, <code>10</code> (2), <code>110</code> (6).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; La idea: adivinar el \u00faltimo d\u00edgito</span>\n    <p>\n      Es un \"termina con 1\". El AFND se queda en q0 leyendo cualquier cosa y, cuando lee un 1,\n      <strong>adivina</strong> que es el \u00faltimo y pasa a q1. Si adivin\u00f3 mal (viene otro d\u00edgito), ese\n      camino muere; mientras tanto el lazo de q0 sigui\u00f3 leyendo por otro camino.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Leyendo lo de adelante, cualquier cosa (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 el 1 del final (final; no sale nada).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>q0 con 1 tiene dos flechas (se queda o pasa a q1): eso lo hace AFND. En la tabla, cada casilla es el conjunto de estados a los que puede ir, y \"&mdash;\" si no hay flecha.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>q0</td><td>{q0, q1}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1 *</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Sin estado muerto: una flecha que falta es que la cadena muere ah\u00ed. Con <code>10</code>, el\n      camino q0 &rarr;1 q1 muere (q1 no tiene flecha con 0) y el otro, q0 &rarr;1 q0 &rarr;0 q0,\n      termina en q0, que no es final: rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e2-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 252 108\" width=\"252\" height=\"108\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0, 1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cosa adelante (incluso nada).</li>\n      <li><code>1</code>: el \u00faltimo d\u00edgito, obligatorio.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial con lazo 0, 1; q0 &rarr;1 q1; q1 final).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>1</code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>101</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;1 q0 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;1 q1</td><td>S\u00ed: es 5</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>110</code></td><td>los que pasan a q1 mueren con el d\u00edgito siguiente; el \u00fanico que llega al final es q0 &rarr;1 q0 &rarr;1 q0 &rarr;0 q0</td><td>No: termina en q0, que no es final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\u03b5</code></td><td>se queda en q0</td><td>No: q0 no es final</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li><code class=\"er\">1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>1</code> deja afuera al <code>1</code>, que es impar.</li>\n        <li>Ponerle a q1 un lazo con 0, 1 lo convierte en \"contiene un 1\": aceptar\u00eda <code>10</code>. En un \"termina con\", del final no sale nada.</li>\n        <li>Los ceros a la izquierda (<code>0111</code>) se aceptan: sigue siendo el 7. Si no se quisieran, la cadena tendr\u00eda que empezar con 1 y ser\u00eda otro aut\u00f3mata.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 3 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 26</span>\n    <h2>Longitud m\u00faltiplo de 3</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {x, y} de longitud m\u00faltiplo de 3 o de longitud 0.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>xyx</code>, <code>yyy</code>, <code>xxyyxy</code> (6).</li>\n      <li>No: <code>x</code>, <code>xy</code>, <code>xyxy</code> (4).</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>El \"o de longitud 0\" no agrega nada: 0 = 3 &middot; 0 ya es m\u00faltiplo de 3. Sirve para acordarse de aceptar <code>\u03b5</code>.</p>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>El resto de dividir por 3 la cantidad de letras le\u00eddas: 0, 1 o 2. Tres estados.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Ley\u00f3 0, 3, 6... letras (resto 0). Inicial y final.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 1, 4, 7... (resto 1).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Ley\u00f3 2, 5, 8... (resto 2).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>Cada letra suma 1 al largo: avanza al siguiente estado de la vuelta, y desde q2 vuelve a q0.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>x</th><th>y</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0 *</td><td>q1</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>q2</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>q0</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ac\u00e1 no hay nada que adivinar: el AFND es este mismo aut\u00f3mata. Y no le falta ninguna flecha,\n      as\u00ed que ninguna cadena muere: todas terminan de leerse en q0, q1 o q2.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e3-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 268 206\" width=\"268\" height=\"206\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L157.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M157.0,0.0 L148.0,4.5 L148.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"88.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M166.1,16.2 L97.9,127.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M97.9,127.8 L98.8,117.8 L106.4,122.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"151.6\" y=\"84.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M78.1,127.8 L9.9,16.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M9.9,16.2 L18.4,21.5 L10.8,26.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"24.4\" y=\"84.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">x, y</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"176.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"176.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"88.0\" cy=\"144.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"88.0\" y=\"144.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: una letra cualquiera.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un bloque de tres letras.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cero o m\u00e1s bloques: largo 0, 3, 6...</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (tres estados en vuelta; q0 inicial y final).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\u03b5</code></td><td>se queda en q0</td><td>S\u00ed: largo 0</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>xy</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;x q1 &rarr;y q2</td><td>No: largo 2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>yxyxxy</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;y q1 &rarr;x q2 &rarr;y q0 &rarr;x q1 &rarr;x q2 &rarr;y q0</td><td>S\u00ed: largo 6</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>xxx<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>yyy<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> deja afuera <code>xyx</code>: las tres letras del bloque son cualesquiera.</li>\n        <li>\"O de longitud 0\" no pide un estado aparte: ya lo cubre q0.</li>\n        <li>La receta sirve para cualquier \"largo m\u00faltiplo de n\": n estados en vuelta y la ER con n veces <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>x<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>y<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code> adentro de la estrella.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 4 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 7</span>\n    <h2>Empiezan y terminan con 0</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {0, 1} que comiencen y terminen con 0.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>0</code> (una sola letra: es la primera y la \u00faltima a la vez), <code>00</code>, <code>010</code>, <code>0110</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code> (no tiene primera letra), <code>1</code>, <code>01</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>101</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; La idea: adivinar el \u00faltimo 0</span>\n    <p>\n      Se arma igual que la ER <code class=\"er\">0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code>: un 0 obligatorio al principio, despu\u00e9s\n      cualquier cosa, y un 0 que el AFND <strong>adivina</strong> que es el \u00faltimo. Para la cadena\n      <code>0</code>, el primer 0 puede ser tambi\u00e9n el \u00faltimo: una flecha directa de q0 al final.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>No ley\u00f3 nada (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 el 0 del principio; ahora, cualquier cosa del medio.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Ley\u00f3 el 0 del final (final; no sale nada).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>Con 0, q0 y q1 tienen dos flechas cada uno: eso lo hace AFND. \"&mdash;\" es que no hay flecha.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>{q1, q2}</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>{q1, q2}</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2 *</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Sin estado muerto: una flecha que falta es que la cadena muere ah\u00ed. Con <code>10</code>: q0\n      no tiene flecha con 1, la cadena muere: rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e4-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 412 184\" width=\"412\" height=\"184\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0, 1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.3,12.5 Q160.0,140.0 305.7,12.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M305.7,12.5 L301.9,21.8 L296.0,15.1 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"86.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\">0<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code>: un 0 al principio, cualquier cosa en el medio y un 0 al final. Tiene por lo menos dos letras.</li>\n      <li><code>0</code>: la cadena de una sola letra, que la pieza anterior deja afuera.</li>\n      <li>Se juntan con <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-o\">|</span></code>: <code class=\"er\">0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo, q0 inicial y q2 final.</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\">0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;0 q2</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0110</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;0 q2</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>01</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;0 q2 muere con el 1; el otro, q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;1 q1, termina en q1</td><td>No: q1 no es final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>10</code></td><td>q0 no tiene flecha con 1: muere</td><td>No: empieza con 1</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li><code class=\"er\">0<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code> solo deja afuera a <code>0</code>. Siempre probar las cadenas de una letra: en el AFND, sin la flecha q0 &rarr;0 q2 pasa lo mismo.</li>\n        <li>Si q0 fuera final se aceptar\u00eda <code>\u03b5</code>, que no empieza con nada.</li>\n        <li>Hacer q1 final para aceptar <code>0</code>: tambi\u00e9n aceptar\u00eda <code>01</code>. q1 es \"cualquier cosa del medio\", nunca un final.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 5 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 6</span>\n    <h2>Terminan con abb</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {a, b} que terminen con abb.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>abb</code>, <code>aabb</code>, <code>babb</code>, <code>abbabb</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>a</code>, <code>ab</code>, <code>bb</code>, <code>abba</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; La idea: adivinar d\u00f3nde empieza el final</span>\n    <p>\n      q0 lee cualquier cosa con un lazo y, en alguna <code>a</code>, el AFND <strong>adivina</strong>\n      que ah\u00ed empieza el <code>abb</code> del final y sigue el camino a, b, b. Si adivin\u00f3 mal, ese\n      camino muere; el lazo de q0 ya sigui\u00f3 leyendo por otro.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Leyendo lo de adelante, cualquier cosa (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 la <code>a</code> de abb.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>ab</code>.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>abb</code> (final; no sale nada).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>q0 con <code>a</code> tiene dos flechas (se queda o empieza el final): eso lo hace AFND. \"&mdash;\" es que no hay flecha.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>{q0, q1}</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>q3</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3 *</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Sin estado muerto: una flecha que falta es que la cadena muere ah\u00ed. Con <code>abba</code>, el\n      camino q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q2 &rarr;b q3 muere con la \u00faltima a (q3 no tiene flecha con a); el\n      que se queda en q0 termina en q0, que no es final: rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e5-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 524 108\" width=\"524\" height=\"108\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L125.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M125.0,0.0 L116.0,4.5 L116.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"72.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M163.0,0.0 L269.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M269.0,0.0 L260.0,4.5 L260.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M307.0,0.0 L413.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M413.0,0.0 L404.0,4.5 L404.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"432.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"432.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"432.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q3</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cosa antes.</li>\n      <li><code>abb</code>: el final, obligatorio.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial con lazo a, b; q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q2 &rarr;b q3; q3 final).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>abb</code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>babb</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;b q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q2 &rarr;b q3</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aabb</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;a q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q2 &rarr;b q3 (adivina en la segunda a)</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abba</code></td><td>el que llega a q3 muere con la \u00faltima a; los dem\u00e1s terminan en q0 o en q1</td><td>No: termina en a</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>En el AFND de \"termina con\" no hacen falta flechas de vuelta: el lazo de q0 ya espera. Si se adivina mal, ese camino muere y listo.</li>\n        <li>Ponerle a q3 un lazo con a, b lo convierte en \"contiene abb\": aceptar\u00eda <code>abba</code>. En \"termina con\", del final no sale nada.</li>\n        <li>Sin el lazo de q0 solo se acepta la cadena <code>abb</code>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 6 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 12</span>\n    <h2>Contienen tres ceros seguidos</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {0, 1} que contengan tres ceros consecutivos.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>000</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>0001</code>, <code>10001011</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>00</code>, <code>0100</code>, <code>1001001</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; La idea: adivinar d\u00f3nde empieza el 000</span>\n    <p>\n      Se arma igual que la ER: q0 con lazo de todo (lo de antes), el camino 0, 0, 0 y un final con\n      lazo de todo (lo de despu\u00e9s). En alg\u00fan 0, el AFND <strong>adivina</strong> que ah\u00ed empieza el\n      <code>000</code>.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Leyendo lo de antes, cualquier cosa (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 el primer 0 del 000.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>00</code>.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>Ya apareci\u00f3 <code>000</code> (final). Lo de despu\u00e9s, cualquier cosa.</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>q0 con 0 tiene dos flechas (se queda o empieza el 000): eso lo hace AFND. \"&mdash;\" es que no hay flecha.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>{q0, q1}</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>q2</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>q3</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3 *</td><td>q3</td><td>q3</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Sin estado muerto: una flecha que falta es que la cadena muere ah\u00ed. Con <code>0100</code>, el\n      camino q0 &rarr;0 q1 muere con el 1 (q1 no tiene flecha con 1), y los que adivinan en los\n      \u00faltimos ceros terminan en q1 o q2: ninguno llega a q3, rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e6-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 545 108\" width=\"545\" height=\"108\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0, 1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L125.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M125.0,0.0 L116.0,4.5 L116.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"72.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M163.0,0.0 L269.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M269.0,0.0 L260.0,4.5 L260.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M307.0,0.0 L413.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M413.0,0.0 L404.0,4.5 L404.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"360.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M423.1,-16.8 C392.0,-51.2 472.0,-51.2 440.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M440.9,-16.8 L443.6,-26.5 L450.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"432.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0, 1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"432.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"432.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"432.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q3</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cosa antes.</li>\n      <li><code>000</code>: la subcadena.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cosa despu\u00e9s.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial con lazo 0, 1; q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;0 q2 &rarr;0 q3; q3 final con lazo 0, 1).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>000<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>1000</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;1 q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;0 q2 &rarr;0 q3</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>00010</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;0 q2 &rarr;0 q3 &rarr;1 q3 &rarr;0 q3</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0100</code></td><td>el que adivina en el primer 0 muere con el 1; los dem\u00e1s terminan en q0, q1 o q2</td><td>No: nunca hay tres seguidos</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>En el AFND de \"contiene\" no hacen falta flechas de vuelta (q1 con 1 a q0, etc.): el lazo de q0 ya espera.</li>\n        <li>\"Contiene\" y \"termina con\" se diferencian en el final: ac\u00e1 q3 lleva lazo con todo (lo de despu\u00e9s); en \"termina con\", del final no sale nada.</li>\n        <li>\"Tres ceros consecutivos\" no es \"tres ceros\": <code>1001001</code> tiene tres ceros y no entra.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 7 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 8</span>\n    <h2>Contienen 001 o 100</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {0, 1} que contengan como subcadenas a 001 o 100.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>001</code>, <code>100</code>, <code>1001</code> (tiene las dos), <code>01001</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>000</code>, <code>0101</code>, <code>0110</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>\n      Con un \"o\" entre dos subcadenas, lo m\u00e1s corto es un <strong>AFND</strong>: un camino para cada\n      subcadena, que comparten el comienzo y el final. El aut\u00f3mata \"adivina\" d\u00f3nde empieza la subcadena.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Todav\u00eda no empez\u00f3 la subcadena (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>0</code> de 001.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>00</code> de 001.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>1</code> de 100.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q4</td><td>Ley\u00f3 <code>10</code> de 100.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q5</td><td>Ya apareci\u00f3 una de las dos (final).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>Cada casilla es el <strong>conjunto</strong> de estados a los que puede ir; \"&mdash;\" si no hay flecha:</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>{q0, q1}</td><td>{q0, q3}</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>q2</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>q5</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>q4</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q4</td><td>q5</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q5 *</td><td>q5</td><td>q5</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Es AFND porque q0 tiene dos flechas con el mismo s\u00edmbolo. Acepta si <strong>alg\u00fan</strong>\n      camino termina en q5. Sin estado muerto: una flecha que falta es que la cadena muere ah\u00ed.\n      Con <code>01</code>, el camino q0 &rarr;0 q1 muere con el 1 (q1 no tiene flecha con 1) y los\n      otros terminan en q0 o q3: rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e7-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 586 222\" width=\"586\" height=\"222\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M8.9,96.8 C40.0,131.2 -40.0,131.2 -8.9,96.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-8.9,96.8 L-11.6,106.5 L-18.3,100.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"136.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0, 1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M16.6,70.8 L127.4,9.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M127.4,9.2 L121.7,17.5 L117.3,9.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"66.2\" y=\"29.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M163.0,0.0 L269.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M269.0,0.0 L260.0,4.5 L260.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M304.6,9.2 L415.4,70.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M415.4,70.8 L405.3,70.3 L409.7,62.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"365.8\" y=\"29.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M16.6,89.2 L127.4,150.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M127.4,150.8 L117.3,150.3 L121.7,142.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"77.8\" y=\"109.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M163.0,160.0 L269.0,160.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M269.0,160.0 L260.0,164.5 L260.0,155.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"150.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M304.6,150.8 L415.4,89.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M415.4,89.2 L409.7,97.5 L405.3,89.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"354.2\" y=\"109.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M448.8,71.1 C483.2,40.0 483.2,120.0 448.8,88.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M448.8,88.9 L458.5,91.6 L452.4,98.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"498.2\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0, 1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,80.0 L-19.0,80.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,80.0 L-28.0,84.5 L-28.0,75.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"432.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"432.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"432.0\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q5</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cosa antes.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>001<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>100<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: una de las dos subcadenas. Los par\u00e9ntesis son obligatorios.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cosa despu\u00e9s.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial, q5 final).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>001<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>100<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>1001</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;1 q3 &rarr;0 q4 &rarr;0 q5 &rarr;1 q5</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>01001</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;1 q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;0 q2 &rarr;1 q5</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0101</code></td><td>ning\u00fan camino llega a q5: los que salen de q0 se cortan antes (no hay 001 ni 100)</td><td>No</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Sin el lazo de q0 solo se aceptan cadenas que <strong>empiezan</strong> con 001 o 100.</li>\n        <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>001<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>100<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> sin par\u00e9ntesis es otra cosa: el <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-o\">|</span></code> es lo \u00faltimo que se aplica y parte la ER en \"termina con 001\" o \"empieza con 100\".</li>\n        <li>No hacen falta flechas de vuelta ni transiciones \u03b5 para separar las ramas: las dos salen de q0 con su primer s\u00edmbolo, y el lazo de q0 ya espera.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 8 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 14</span>\n    <h2>Sin dos unos seguidos</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {0, 1} que no contengan dos unos consecutivos.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>0101</code>, <code>1001</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>11</code>, <code>0110</code>, <code>111</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>\n      Si lo \u00faltimo fue 1 (otro 1 lo arruina). En un \"no contiene\", <strong>todos los estados son\n      finales</strong>: la que no sirve no llega al final de la lectura.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>No ley\u00f3 nada o lo \u00faltimo fue 0 (inicial y final).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Lo \u00faltimo fue 1 (final).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0 *</td><td>q0</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1 *</td><td>q0</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ac\u00e1 no hay nada que adivinar: el AFND es el AFD sin el estado muerto. Una flecha que falta es\n      que la cadena muere ah\u00ed: con <code>0110</code>, q1 no tiene flecha con 1, la cadena muere:\n      rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e8-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 252 130\" width=\"252\" height=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 Q80.0,-36.0 142.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-7.8 L132.6,-7.4 L136.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M142.7,7.8 Q80.0,36.0 17.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L27.4,7.4 L23.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <p>Una ER no puede \"restar\" el <code>11</code>: se arma con piezas que nunca lo generen.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>0</code>: un cero suelto.</li>\n      <li><code>10</code>: un uno con el cero que lo sigue (as\u00ed nunca viene otro 1 pegado).</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier fila de esas piezas. Siempre termina en 0 (o es vac\u00eda).</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: al final se puede agregar un 1 suelto.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo, q0 inicial, q0 y q1 finales.</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\u03b5</code></td><td>se queda en q0</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>1001</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;1 q1</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0110</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;1 q1, y q1 no tiene flecha con 1: muere</td><td>No: tiene 11</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Sin el <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>, la ER deja afuera <code>1</code> y <code>01</code>.</li>\n        <li>Si q1 no fuera final se perder\u00edan las que terminan en 1.</li>\n        <li>Dar vuelta los finales del AF de \"contiene 11\" solo sirve con un AFD completo, muerto incluido (el muerto pasa a ser final); sin el muerto o con un AFND, no anda. Un \"no contiene\" se piensa directo, como ac\u00e1.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 9 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 15</span>\n    <h2>Sin la subcadena 101</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {0, 1} que no contengan la cadena 101.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>100</code>, <code>1001</code>, <code>110011</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>101</code>, <code>0101</code>, <code>1101</code>, <code>10100</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>Cu\u00e1nto lleva armado de <code>101</code>: nada, <code>1</code> o <code>10</code>. Si se forma, la cadena muere.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Nada armado: no ley\u00f3 nada, o lo \u00faltimo fue un 0 que no sirve (como el de <code>100</code>). Inicial y final.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Lo \u00faltimo fue <code>1</code> (final).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Lo \u00faltimo fue <code>10</code> (final).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>q1 con <code>1</code>: lo \u00faltimo es <code>11</code>; el segundo 1 puede ser el comienzo de 101: se queda en q1.</li>\n      <li>q2 con <code>0</code>: lo \u00faltimo es <code>100</code>; el <code>00</code> no sirve para nada: vuelve a q0.</li>\n      <li>q2 con <code>1</code>: se form\u00f3 101: no hay flecha.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0 *</td><td>q0</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1 *</td><td>q2</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2 *</td><td>q0</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ac\u00e1 no hay nada que adivinar: el AFND es el AFD sin el estado muerto. Una flecha que falta es\n      que la cadena muere ah\u00ed: con <code>0101</code>, q2 no tiene flecha con 1, la cadena muere:\n      rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e9-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 412 163\" width=\"412\" height=\"163\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M303.9,10.1 Q160.0,100.0 16.1,10.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M16.1,10.1 L26.1,11.0 L21.4,18.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"65.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <p>El problema es un 0 <strong>solo</strong> entre dos unos. Se arma con piezas que no lo permitan:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>0</code>: un cero suelto.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\">11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>00</code>: uno o m\u00e1s unos seguidos de por lo menos dos ceros (despu\u00e9s de los unos nunca queda un 0 solo).</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>00<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier fila de esas piezas. Siempre termina en 0 o es vac\u00eda.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: el final puede ser nada, unos (<code class=\"er\">11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>), o unos y un solo 0 (<code class=\"er\">11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code>): despu\u00e9s de ese 0 ya no viene nada.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo, q0 inicial, todos finales.</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>00<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>1001</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;0 q2 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;1 q1</td><td>S\u00ed. En la ER: <code>100</code> + <code>1</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>110</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;0 q2</td><td>S\u00ed. En la ER: final <code class=\"er\">11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0101</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;0 q2, y q2 no tiene flecha con 1: muere</td><td>No: tiene 101</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>\"No contiene la cadena 101\" habla de 101 <strong>seguidos</strong>: <code>1001</code> entra.</li>\n        <li>Sin el final <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span><span class=\"er-e\">\u03b5</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code> se pierden las que terminan en 1 o en 10.</li>\n        <li>q2 con 0 vuelve a q0, no a q1: <code>100</code> no deja nada armado.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 10 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 9</span>\n    <h2>Identificadores con guiones</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>\n        Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para los identificadores de cualquier longitud\n        que comiencen con una letra y contengan letras, d\u00edgitos o guiones, que no contengan dos guiones\n        seguidos ni terminen con guion.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; El alfabeto y ejemplos</span>\n    <p>\n      Un AF con una flecha por cada letra y cada d\u00edgito ser\u00eda ilegible. Se usa un s\u00edmbolo por clase,\n      y <strong>se aclara en la hoja</strong>: <strong>L</strong> = una letra, <strong>D</strong> = un\n      d\u00edgito, <strong>G</strong> = un guion. El alfabeto queda {L, D, G}.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>x</code> (L), <code>a1b</code> (LDL), <code>a-1</code> (LGD), <code>mi-var2</code> (LLGLLLD).</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>1a</code> (DL), <code>-a</code> (GL), <code>a-</code> (LG), <code>a--b</code> (LGGL).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>Si ya empez\u00f3 bien (con una letra) y si lo \u00faltimo fue un guion.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>No ley\u00f3 nada (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Empez\u00f3 con letra y lo \u00faltimo no es guion: identificador v\u00e1lido hasta ac\u00e1 (final).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Lo \u00faltimo fue un guion: no puede terminar ac\u00e1 ni leer otro guion.</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>L</th><th>D</th><th>G</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>q1</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1 *</td><td>q1</td><td>q1</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>q1</td><td>q1</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ac\u00e1 no hay nada que adivinar: el AFND es el AFD sin el estado muerto. Una flecha que falta es\n      que la cadena muere ah\u00ed: con <code>DL</code> (1a), q0 no tiene flecha con D, la cadena muere:\n      rechazada. Lo mismo q0 con G y q2 con G.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e10-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 412 130\" width=\"412\" height=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">L</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">L, D</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-7.8 Q240.0,-36.0 302.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M302.7,-7.8 L292.6,-7.4 L296.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">G</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M302.7,7.8 Q240.0,36.0 177.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M177.3,7.8 L187.4,7.4 L183.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">L, D</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>L</code>: la primera, obligatoria.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: una letra o un d\u00edgito.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\">G<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un guion <strong>pegado</strong> a la letra o d\u00edgito que lo sigue. As\u00ed nunca hay dos guiones seguidos ni uno al final.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>G<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cualquier cantidad de esas piezas.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p>L = letra, D = d\u00edgito, G = guion.</p>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo, q0 inicial y q1 final.</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\">L<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>G<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>LLGLLLD</code> (mi-var2)</td><td>q0 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;G q2 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;D q1</td><td>S\u00ed</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>LG</code> (a-)</td><td>q0 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;G q2</td><td>No: q2 no es final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>LGGL</code> (a--b)</td><td>q0 &rarr;L q1 &rarr;G q2, y q2 no tiene flecha con G: muere</td><td>No: dos guiones</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>DL</code> (1a)</td><td>q0 no tiene flecha con D: muere</td><td>No: empieza con d\u00edgito</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li><code class=\"er\">L<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>G<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> acepta <code>a-</code> y <code>a--b</code>: el guion suelto en la estrella no controla nada.</li>\n        <li>Si no se dice qu\u00e9 es L, D y G, la respuesta queda incompleta.</li>\n        <li>q2 no es final: un identificador no puede terminar con guion.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 11 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 28</span>\n    <h2>Impar de 0 y par de 1</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {0, 1} con un n\u00famero impar de 0s y un n\u00famero par de 1s.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>0</code>, <code>000</code>, <code>011</code>, <code>101</code>, <code>110</code>, <code>01111</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code> (cero 0s: par), <code>1</code>, <code>00</code>, <code>01</code>, <code>0110</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>\n      Dos condiciones unidas por \"y\", cada una con dos posibilidades (par o impar): un estado por\n      cada <strong>combinaci\u00f3n</strong>, 2 &times; 2 = 4 estados.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>Par de 0, par de 1. Inicial (cero de cada uno).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Impar de 0, par de 1 (final).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Par de 0, impar de 1.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>Impar de 0, impar de 1.</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>Un 0 cambia solo la paridad de los 0 (q0 &harr; q1, q2 &harr; q3); un 1, solo la de los 1 (q0 &harr; q2, q1 &harr; q3).</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>0</th><th>1</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>q1</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1 *</td><td>q0</td><td>q3</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>q3</td><td>q0</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>q2</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ac\u00e1 no hay nada que adivinar: el AFND es este mismo aut\u00f3mata. Y no le falta ninguna flecha,\n      as\u00ed que ninguna cadena muere: todas terminan de leerse en alguno de los cuatro estados.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e11-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 320 280\" width=\"320\" height=\"280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M18.0,-6.2 Q104.0,-36.0 190.0,-6.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M190.0,-6.2 L180.1,-4.9 L183.0,-13.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"104.0\" y=\"-31.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M190.0,6.2 Q104.0,36.0 18.0,6.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M18.0,6.2 L27.9,4.9 L25.0,13.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"104.0\" y=\"31.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M18.0,169.8 Q104.0,140.0 190.0,169.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M190.0,169.8 L180.1,171.1 L183.0,162.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"104.0\" y=\"144.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M190.0,182.2 Q104.0,212.0 18.0,182.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M18.0,182.2 L27.9,180.9 L25.0,189.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"104.0\" y=\"207.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M7.2,17.6 Q36.0,88.0 7.2,158.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M7.2,158.4 L6.4,148.4 L14.8,151.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"35.4\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-7.2,158.4 Q-36.0,88.0 -7.2,17.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-7.2,17.6 L-6.4,27.6 L-14.8,24.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"-35.4\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M215.2,17.6 Q244.0,88.0 215.2,158.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M215.2,158.4 L214.4,148.4 L222.8,151.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"243.4\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M200.8,158.4 Q172.0,88.0 200.8,17.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M200.8,17.6 L201.6,27.6 L193.2,24.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"172.6\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"208.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"208.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"208.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"208.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"208.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q3</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <p>Con paridades conviene leer la cadena <strong>de a pares de s\u00edmbolos</strong>:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un par que no cambia ninguna paridad (suma dos 0 o dos 1).</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un par \"mezclado\", que da vuelta las dos paridades.</li>\n      <li>\n        <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: cadenas con par de 0 y par de 1 (de q0 a q0).\n        Pares que no cambian nada, o un mezclado, pares que no cambian y otro mezclado que vuelve\n        a dar vuelta todo. La llamamos <strong>P</strong>.\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        Impar de 0 y par de 1 da largo impar: se separa el <strong>\u00faltimo</strong> s\u00edmbolo.\n        Si es 0, lo de antes tiene par de 0 y par de 1: <code>P0</code>. Si es 1, lo de antes tiene\n        impar de 0 e impar de 1, o sea una cantidad impar de pares mezclados:\n        <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span>P1</code>.\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial, q1 final).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>01<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>1</code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>101</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;1 q2 &rarr;0 q3 &rarr;1 q1</td><td>S\u00ed. En la ER: <code>10</code> (mezclado) y el <code>1</code> final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>000</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;0 q0 &rarr;0 q1</td><td>S\u00ed. En la ER: <code>00</code> y el <code>0</code> final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>0110</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;0 q1 &rarr;1 q3 &rarr;1 q1 &rarr;0 q0</td><td>No: dos 0</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>\u03b5</code></td><td>se queda en q0</td><td>No: q0 no es final</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Armar la ER con estrellas sueltas, como <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>0<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>00<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>11<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: deja afuera <code>101</code>, donde los 1 no est\u00e1n juntos.</li>\n        <li>El inicial es \"par y par\", no es final.</li>\n        <li>La ER tambi\u00e9n sale eliminando estados (Unidad 2): da otra m\u00e1s larga, igual de v\u00e1lida.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ej\" data-examen=\"variante\"\n       data-examen-ref=\"Parciales 2023-2025 \u00b7 ej. 3\"\n       data-examen-nota=\"La misma consigna que el ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos).\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Ejercicio 12 &middot; TP I &middot; ej. 66</span>\n    <h2>Empiezan y terminan con a, impar de a, largo par</h2>\n    <div class=\"enunciado\">\n      <p>Realice un AFD o AFND y una expresi\u00f3n regular para el conjunto de cadenas sobre {a, b} que comiencen y terminen con a, con cantidad impar de a, y longitud par.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 1 &mdash; Ejemplos que s\u00ed y que no</span>\n    <ul>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>aaba</code>, <code>abaa</code>, <code>aabbba</code>, <code>ababba</code>.</li>\n      <li>No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>a</code> (largo 1), <code>aa</code> (dos a), <code>aaa</code> (largo 3), <code>abba</code> (dos a), <code>baab</code> (empieza con b).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 2 &mdash; Qu\u00e9 tiene que recordar el aut\u00f3mata</span>\n    <p>\n      La cadena es <code>a w a</code>. Las dos a de las puntas suman 2, as\u00ed que el medio\n      <code>w</code> tiene que tener <strong>impar de a</strong> y <strong>largo par</strong>; y si\n      tiene largo par e impar de a, tiene <strong>impar de b</strong>. Queda: una a, un medio con\n      impar de a e impar de b, y una a.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Se arma un <strong>AFND</strong>: despu\u00e9s de la primera a, cuatro estados cuentan las paridades\n      del medio (como en el ejercicio 11); desde \"impar e impar\", una a puede ser la \u00faltima.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0</td><td>No ley\u00f3 nada (inicial).</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Ley\u00f3 la primera a; el medio va con par de a y par de b.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>Medio con impar de a, par de b.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>Medio con par de a, impar de b.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q4</td><td>Medio con impar de a, impar de b.</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q5</td><td>Ley\u00f3 la a final (final; no sale nada).</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 3 &mdash; Transiciones y dibujo</span>\n    <p>Entre q1 y q4, una a cambia la paridad de las a y una b la de las b. Desde q4 con a hay dos caminos: esa a es del medio (q3) o es la \u00faltima (q5).</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; q0</td><td>q1</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>q2</td><td>q3</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2</td><td>q1</td><td>q4</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q3</td><td>q4</td><td>q1</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q4</td><td>{q3, q5}</td><td>q2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q5 *</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>&mdash;</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Es un <strong>AFND</strong>: q4 tiene dos flechas con a. Acepta si alg\u00fan camino termina en q5.\n      Sin estado muerto: una flecha que falta es que la cadena muere ah\u00ed. Con <code>baab</code>, q0\n      no tiene flecha con b, la cadena muere: rechazada.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-e12-af\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 588 281\" width=\"588\" height=\"281\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L125.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M125.0,0.0 L116.0,4.5 L116.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"72.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M161.8,-6.7 Q240.0,-36.0 318.2,-6.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M318.2,-6.7 L308.2,-5.6 L311.4,-14.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"-31.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M318.2,6.7 Q240.0,36.0 161.8,6.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M161.8,6.7 L171.8,5.6 L168.6,14.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"31.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M161.8,169.3 Q240.0,140.0 318.2,169.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M318.2,169.3 L308.2,170.4 L311.4,162.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"144.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M318.2,182.7 Q240.0,212.0 161.8,182.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M161.8,182.7 L171.8,181.6 L168.6,190.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"207.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.2,17.6 Q180.0,88.0 151.2,158.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M151.2,158.4 L150.4,148.4 L158.8,151.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"179.4\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M136.8,158.4 Q108.0,88.0 136.8,17.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M136.8,17.6 L137.6,27.6 L129.2,24.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"108.6\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M343.2,17.6 Q372.0,88.0 343.2,158.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M343.2,158.4 L342.4,148.4 L350.8,151.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"371.4\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M328.8,158.4 Q300.0,88.0 328.8,17.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M328.8,17.6 L329.6,27.6 L321.2,24.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"300.6\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M355.0,176.0 L477.0,176.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M477.0,176.0 L468.0,180.5 L468.0,171.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"416.0\" y=\"166.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"336.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"336.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"336.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"336.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"496.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"496.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"496.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q5</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"paso\">Paso 4 &mdash; La ER, por piezas</span>\n    <p>El medio se lee de a pares, como en el ejercicio 11:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un par que no cambia ninguna paridad.</li>\n      <li><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code>: un par mezclado, que da vuelta las dos.</li>\n      <li>Impar de a e impar de b = una cantidad <strong>impar</strong> de pares mezclados: <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> hasta el primero, <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span></code> el primero, y despu\u00e9s una cantidad par de mezclados: <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</li>\n      <li>Las dos a de las puntas: <code>a</code> al principio y <code>a</code> al final.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-resp\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Respuesta</span>\n      <p><strong>AFND:</strong> el del dibujo (q0 inicial, q5 final).</p>\n      <p><strong>ER:</strong> <code class=\"er\">a<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>bb<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>ab<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>a</code></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Probamos con cadenas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Cadena</th><th>Recorrido</th><th>\u00bfLa acepta?</th></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aaba</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;a q2 &rarr;b q4 &rarr;a q5</td><td>S\u00ed. En la ER: <code>a</code> + <code>ab</code> + <code>a</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aabbba</code></td><td>hay un camino: q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;a q2 &rarr;b q4 &rarr;b q2 &rarr;b q4 &rarr;a q5</td><td>S\u00ed. En la ER: <code>a</code> + <code>ab</code> + <code>bb</code> + <code>a</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>abba</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;b q3 &rarr;b q1 &rarr;a q2</td><td>No: el medio <code>bb</code> no tiene a</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><code>aaa</code></td><td>q0 &rarr;a q1 &rarr;a q2 &rarr;a q1</td><td>No: largo impar</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Contar las paridades de toda la cadena y olvidarse de que las dos a de las puntas tambi\u00e9n cuentan.</li>\n        <li>Traducir \"largo par\" a \"impar de b\" (en el medio) simplifica: quedan dos paridades, como en el ejercicio 11.</li>\n        <li>La cadena <code>a</code> empieza y termina con a, pero tiene largo 1: probar siempre los bordes.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>");
